  "description": "Office document loaders for Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx), and PowerPoint (.pptx). Parses documents into DoclingDocument structured models via OpenXml, preserving heading hierarchy and slide content order.",
  "id": "Mythosia.Documents.Office",
